UFO FUTURE - COMMUNITY EDITING

Original work
UFO Future was originally created by Raishxn. The source code, gameplay concepts, resources, documentation, and project history in this repository are from the original project.

Maintained version
This repository contains a modified, community-maintained version of UFO Future. I am porting the project to Minecraft 26.1.2 and making compatibility, maintenance, and performance changes. This is not a release from raishxns.
Copyright from raishxns may not be modified, changed in any way, or misrepresented.

